From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 16:50:15 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] protocol: use explicit Vulkan SDK inputs and handle aliases

Consume registry and headers from an explicit prepared Vulkan-Headers source. Keep generated codecs in the build directory, preserve promoted-alias resolution and initialized size-only returns, and leave the upstream vendored SDK copies unchanged. Input authentication belongs to the invoking preparation workflow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
